{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/283","id":4930073598,"node_id":"PR_kwDORoMukM8AAAABJdrz_g","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/283","diff_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/283.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/283.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/283","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/283/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/283/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/283/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/statuses/395bafe51d79374f6ef57fdfd772a6d1121f7ef0","number":283,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(html-guide-kit): retain asset notices and improve input boundaries","user":{"login":"ranzuozhou","id":35538471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTM4NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35538471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou","html_url":"https://github.com/ranzuozhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Bug 描述\n\n生成器复制网页资产时未携带许可文本；空白反思输入框的必要边界对纸背景仅2.357:1、对白仅2.483:1。延期恢复检查还发现Unicode和Windows尾点/空格路径在生成器与静态检查器间判定不一致。\n\n## 根因分析\n\n输出清单漏掉包级许可资源，安装比较漏查根LICENSE；输入框边界颜色偏浅；路径保留键的大小写算法和可移植路径规则不一致。\n\n## 修复方案\n\n- HTML0.1.38候选输出原MIT LICENSE、Apache文本及有范围说明/完整原notice尾部的THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES，全部入manifest。输入材料保留原权利；包级许可缺件在首次写入前失败。\n- 原输入框边界改#767676，统一保留键并拒绝路径组件尾点/空格；安装比较补根LICENSE。\n- 在原PLAN/REPORT梳理D01–D07及恢复条件，自主完成限定浏览器、材料异常、离线恢复及同私有Site只读观测。保留原失败；独立选证审查发现的研究摘录已在提交前移除，仅留哈希/定位。\n\n## 影响范围\n\n仅HTML包、直接相关Harness/测试与任务文档。guide四资源、其他插件、市场VERSION/badge不变。0.1.38尚未公开；公开仍v8.3.2/HTML0.1.37，现有私有站仍原版本/受众。\n\n## 原意与工程覆盖\n\nRefs #274。[唯一INTENT](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/develop/docs/intent/%5BINTENT%5D_INT-2026-003_HTML_Learning_Artifact.md)、[主PLAN](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/395bafe51d79374f6ef57fdfd772a6d1121f7ef0/plans/274-html-learning-artifact/%5BPLAN%5D_HTML_Learning_Artifact.md#deferral-recovery-batch)、[REPORT/证据入口](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/395bafe51d79374f6ef57fdfd772a6d1121f7ef0/plans/274-html-learning-artifact/%5BREPORT%5D_HTML_Learning_Artifact.md#deferral-recovery-results)。32项原接受基线前五列及原1417来源/字节保持。本PR落实C17/C21及D04–D06可自治子集；工程修复不代表完整计划达成。Owner已经ACCEPTED_LIMITED核心，D01原生窗口、D02原生派发、D03第二客户端、扩大视觉/设备/语义/生产恢复仍延期，效果NOT_MEASURED，历史批准NOT_MET/bypass不可追认。\n\n## 可重复的本地验证\n\n- 实际完整647项：646PASS、0FAIL、1平台专用skip；首次2项CHANGELOG格式FAIL原件保留并修正。\n- strict、CLI0.147.0精确基线通过；文档/INTENT116项通过。1890来源暂存Gitblob全部逐SHA256匹配；原1417前缀/字节不变。\n- 独立代码审查修后9路径负例零写、3许可回归、6安装缺件/篡改通过；安装生成10文件/manifest9，实际Python95检查通过。3视口6截图实看，边界对纸4.3116:1/对白4.5422:1，键盘与复制失败恢复通过。\n- 新13种隔离安装已实际结束：178命令全exit0、6Diagram18LEK/4生成4静态各95/95、四产物各10物理文件、site20/guide4与LICENSE原bytes相同，14自有根全部清理。原整体summary=FAIL/exit1保留（期间授权HEAD908→470触发元数据guard，另有超长路径stat观测）；独立提取只确认实际安装子项，不改称actual470新跑。首次后处理错误也保留。\n\n## AI 判断与剩余门禁\n\n独立代码及选证审查无未解决发现。通用checker只核自洽，不能独立认证许可/材料真实性；全法律判断、完整WCAG、真实原生/第二客户端与学习效果未宣称通过。当前395bafe head CI已通过；真实非作者/最新推送者之外的批准及合入时线程/最新base仍须满足；Agent不bypass、不指定审查人。无必须现在交Owner的产品决定。\n\n首470候选两Windows job在checkout step2因新增证据路径过长FAIL，未执行测试。395bafe将证据根缩为dr274，424原件bytes不变，最长相对215→194、CI绝对268→247，映射和原日志完整保留；移位后116文档/INTENT与strict通过，无workflow/Harness放宽。修后精确head PR CI39359262844双系统已终态通过：每端647总/646PASS/0FAIL/1平台不适用skip，实际各13安装/178命令全0、6Diagram18LEK Python、4生成4静态各95/95。Ubuntu Python3.12.15、Windows Python3.12.10，CLI0.147.0。push39359256807经等价PR证明去重，其matrix skipped。当前Structure/A6通过，PR已转ready，待真实保护批准。后继CI/批准/合入只回Issue与外部冻结回执，不为CI自身反复提交证据。\n\n## 风险与恢复\n\n生成制品由7变10物理文件，下游若维护精确清单须保留新许可文件。保留旧公开tag/原私有Site版本；本地损坏/拒覆写/备份恢复已5步实证。必要问题可停止升级、修复或经受保护PR回退；无新发布、生产回滚或自动监控。\n\n## 自检结果\n\n- [x] Bug已复现并在独立固定源范围验证修复\n- [x] 当前本机完整回归通过，未覆盖范围逐项保留\n- [x] 无残留调试代码、凭据或未知权利研究正文\n- [x] Commit message符合fix(html-guide-kit)及真实Codex署名\n- [x] CHANGELOG当前部分已更新，正式v8.3.2及更早历史保持\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20T02:20:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T02:51:03Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T02:51:03Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T02:51:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"a4892f51f4163fb5bd4457d99229eaf1a4683e8f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MJ-AgentLab:codex/html-learning-deferral-fixes","ref":"codex/html-learning-deferral-fixes","repo":{"id":1183002256,"node_id":"R_kgDORoMukA","name":"mj-agentlab-marketplace","full_name":"MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace","owner":{"login":"MJ-AgentLab","id":262496159,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6Vfnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262496159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://